omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E0ySP3aayQ0Q7kNvwGaV3rZ&_nc_oc=AdoL7i1aspNATxB7R17wPObaT7yssKcOXXf_oFBnymN8r_V-GG7E2zo7IIyaY4g5wMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCo1fRlMHwg5ayS966CnyN4YwxgrkxZXujD2Z_WIftH0Q&oe=6A4FBCB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JLVT9f7fVlQQ7kNvwFqacnB&_nc_oc=Adq76awQLHlhqBZbEVJBd2sCu7LZDsFJ5R2HyUUB1YfyapGI_FDBwvz9OlCmVw0Th9U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCcK2FU6FGB65gwb36x1hEgEssSOHUf-OT3GWvv0mSqsw&oe=6A4FBE16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uzbMbivIRE4Q7kNvwHi9fUB&_nc_oc=Adq7UxXDnoXYqp3Ai3aU3iOUYymHVxBzCV8upxtH-MOtzGbwV7u8RbmdV7yqP9Uf9yA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBbhWGp43Eh_B2rVM3qurh-0YVLfQksm0o7Sc0Z3Tq5oQ&oe=6A4F9AF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://